476	     3	 *
477	     4	 * Pools saved eval runs per model and ranks models by the agreed rule (B4, D107):
478	     5	 * 1) gate: zero failures on premise/data checks and p95 ≤ 30 s;
479	     6	 * 2) accuracy: pass rate, where within 2 case-runs of the best counts as a tie;
480	     7	 * 3) cheapest per answer among the tied; 4) fastest as the final tiebreak.
